---
import "../styles/global.css";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
    <main class="container min-w-full min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-20">
        <div class="max-w-4xl md:text-lg">
            <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif mb-8">About</h1>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                Welcome.
            </p>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                This site is a placeholder while I’m away in training. My work here will evolve over time, but for now it serves a single purpose: to point toward the project that matters most to me.
            </p>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                👉 Visit my Framework Project at 
                <a href="https://framework.antonyotero.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-berkeley underline">framework.antonyotero.com</a>
            </p>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                There you’ll find the beginnings of a practical metaphysics — an attempt to live consciously, carry responsibility, and forge meaning where none is given. It is only a seed right now, but a seed planted intentionally.
            </p>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                Check back later for updates.
            </p>
    
            <p class="mb-4">
                —Antony Otero Espinal
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
